flowchart TB
  OBS2[Observability Stack]
  OBS2 --> METRICS[Micrometer Metrics]
  METRICS --> C[Counters]
  METRICS --> G[Gauges]
  METRICS --> T[Timers]
  METRICS --> DS[Distribution Summaries]
  METRICS --> TAG[Tags]
  METRICS --> ANNO2[Counted / Timed]
  METRICS --> BIND[Micrometer Binders]
  METRICS --> OBSAPI[Observation API]

  OBS2 --> PROM[Prometheus]
  PROM --> SCRAPE[Scrape Config]
  PROM --> EP[Actuator Endpoint]
  PROM --> ALERT[Alerting Rules]

  OBS2 --> GRAF[Grafana]
  GRAF --> DASH[Dashboards]
  DASH --> JVM[JVM Dashboard]
  DASH --> SB[Spring Boot Dashboard]
  DASH --> BIZ[Business Metrics]
  GRAF --> SLI[SLI / SLO / SLA]

  OBS2 --> LOGGING[Log Aggregation]
  LOGGING --> JSON[JSON Logging]
  LOGGING --> MDC[MDC / Correlation ID]
  LOGGING --> ELK[ELK Stack]
  LOGGING --> LOKI[Grafana Loki]

  OBS2 --> ALERTING[Alerting]
  ALERTING --> PROMALERT[Prometheus Alerts]
  ALERTING --> GRAFALERT[Grafana Alerts]
